How mirobody uses it

  mirobody.units is hand-written software that interoperates with UCUM: it
  maps printed unit spellings to UCUM expressions, classifies them by LOINC
  PROPERTY and converts between them. It does not reproduce the
  specification. ucum-essence.xml is read to check that every unit those
  tables name is one UCUM defines and that every conversion factor agrees
  with UCUM's own definitions (mirobody/units/essence.py).
